's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"460eb10a766ee54b77c3f40370437b00","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"0f0211db4dbc51b8c61c387e00ee2f79","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"c91d2bf3f05244e38f41d72d09944b0b","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"5744438a8cb778dbefddf8ab6371cbf6","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"223ef985c5b0b2c65ef006e6b119799d","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"4555b9e280899e8dd0caec07ca36e15a","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"fbf68b3322af6b2fd21b5dede57c890e","originalFileName":"7b863dd4-5ceb-4aa3-a138-958f300061d3-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"68658c4c